# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, regardless
# of OS or local core.autocrlf settings, so Biome/ultracite's formatter (and
# any other LF-only tooling) sees the same bytes on Windows, Linux, and CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types - never touch line endings or diff these as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
